deser_keras_safe_mode — CVE-2025-1550 -> CVE-2025-8747 (Keras, CWE-502)
REBUILT 2026-07-16: REAL Python HTTP service, EXTERNAL HTTP trigger (POST /load).
Real-Docker gate evidence. Variant A (same sink: keras.saving.load_model ->
serialization_lib._retrieve_class_or_fn -> Lambda gadget invocation; same
read-exfil channel: /canary/flag.txt copied into /out by the invoked callable,
returned in the /load HTTP response).
